OL,3,GGrampian                               
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy day with outbreaks of  
OL,6,Fmostly light and patchy rain and hill  
OL,7,Fsnow throughout the day. Any heavier   
OL,8,Fbursts of rain are likely in the       
OL,9,Fmorning. Breezy near the coasts at     
OL,10,Ffirst but winds easing later.          
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will be mostly cloudy      
OL,13,Fthrough the evening and overnight with 
OL,14,Fshowers feeding inland from the east.  
OL,15,FDrier with clear spells further west   
OL,16,Falong the Moray coast.                 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
