OL,3,GGrampian                               
OL,5,CThursday:FA mostly cloudy day with     
OL,6,Fsome brighter intervals. A few showers 
OL,7,Faround in the morning, but these will  
OL,8,Fgradually ease in the afternoon,       
OL,9,Fleaving dry conditions. Winds becoming 
OL,10,Fstrong.                                
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy   
OL,13,Fwith rain, hill snow and strong winds  
OL,14,Fspreading eastwards. Mostly dry and    
OL,15,Fcloudy on Saturday with light winds    
OL,16,Fthen rain overnight. Mostly dry with   
OL,17,Fbright spells on Sunday.               
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
